|CKBPaladin|000

|CK0Paladins are Mitra's armoured holy warriors. They combine direct martial
combat with protection, judgment, mobility, and support, taking a more
aggressive front-line role than Mitra's Clerics.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0Worthy battle earns Paladin XP and raises Guild Level. Each level also
grants Devotion points that shape a personal selection of holy benefits.
Alignment and Charisma matter: evil cuts a Paladin off from Mitra, while higher
ranks demand stronger spiritual presence.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0smite and retribution punish enemies, courage and hpresence strengthen
the faithful, repel drives back evil, sanctify and consecrate prepare holy
ground, javelin provides divine reach, rush closes distance, and warhorse
summons a sacred mount.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Paladin if you want a principled tank or holy bruiser with armour,
party protection, customization through Devotions, and a strict commitment to
Mitra's alignment.|000

|CK0After joining, use |CKBpalhelp advancement|CK0, |CKBpalskills|CK0, and
|CKBdevote|CK0 for the full path.|000

